{"availability":"available","full":"sagarmude7/BookXchanger","name":"BookXchanger","description":"BookXchanger is a website where a person can buy or sell his books. Every year we see that if a student wants to buy second-hand books he has to ask everyone whether they have books or not. Similarly, if a person wants to sell his old books he has to ask everyone and search for buyers. So we try to create a platform where a person can buy or sell his second-hand books without any difficulty. So we try to make a BookXchanger website with almost all the features which can resolve all the problems the buyers or sellers face while buying or selling a book.","category":"Other","language":"JavaScript","stars":18,"forks":9,"created":"2021-02-05T05:20:16Z","updated":"2026-06-07T09:08:00Z","license":"MIT","branch":"main","homepage":"https://bookxchanger.netlify.app","topics":[],"demo":"https://bookxchanger.netlify.app/","color":"#63362a","ink":"#f8c7a8","lastCheckedAt":"2026-10-10T11:07:22.678Z","lastAttemptAt":"2026-10-10T11:07:22.678Z","lastAvailableAt":"2026-10-10T11:07:22.678Z","metrics":[{"at":"2026-10-10T11:07:22.678Z","stars":18,"forks":9}],"technologies":[],"overview":{"kind":"readme","version":1,"paragraphs":["A full-stack MERN marketplace for buying and selling second-hand books — primarily aimed at college students who want to trade textbooks without exchanging phone numbers or email addresses."],"features":["Book listings — post, edit, and delete ads with book details (name, subject, branch, edition, condition, price, image)","Advanced search & filter — search by book name, subject, branch, or condition","Wishlist — save books to review later","Real-time chat — Socket.io-powered messaging between buyers and sellers; no phone numbers or emails are shared","Offline notifications — email alert when you receive a message while offline"],"sourceUrl":"https://github.com/sagarmude7/BookXchanger/blob/main/README.md","fingerprint":"d3f247d8541a5ae73137fdbdbb59633a53d957f8f86d